## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Idle schedulers busy-wait for work by default. On a small machine (one
## or two vCPUs) also running RocksDB's threads and a local Valkey, that
## spinning takes CPU from them, so schedulers sleep as soon as they're idle.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
